sequenceDiagram
    participant Operator as TrustyAI Operator
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Pod as LMEval Job Pod<br/>(CPU only)
    participant EvalHub as EvalHub Service<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Model as Model Serving Endpoint<br/>configurable/TCP
    participant OCI as OCI Registry<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Operator,OCI: Flow 1: EvalHub-Orchestrated Benchmark Evaluation

    Operator->>K8s: Create Job with LMEval image<br/>Mount job spec ConfigMap + auth secrets<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token
    K8s-->>Pod: Pod scheduled & started

    Pod->>Pod: Read /meta/job.json<br/>Resolve credentials<br/>Configure local-completions backend

    Pod->>EvalHub: POST callback: status=INITIALIZING<br/>Auth: Bearer Token

    Pod->>HF: GET tokenizer + benchmark datasets<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (HF_TOKEN)<br/>TLS 1.2+
    HF-->>Pod: Tokenizer files + dataset splits

    Pod->>EvalHub: POST callback: status=RUNNING<br/>Auth: Bearer Token

    loop For each benchmark sample (batched, max 128 concurrent)
        Pod->>Model: POST /v1/completions<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (OPENAI_API_KEY)<br/>TLS configurable (verify_certificate)
        Model-->>Pod: Completion response + logprobs
    end

    Pod->>Pod: Compute metrics<br/>(56 offline metric modules)

    Pod->>EvalHub: POST callback: status=POST_PROCESSING<br/>Auth: Bearer Token

    Pod->>EvalHub: POST callback: status=PERSISTING<br/>Auth: Bearer Token

    Pod->>OCI: skopeo push: evaluation results artifact<br/>Auth: Docker auth config<br/>TLS 1.2+
    OCI-->>Pod: Push confirmed

    Pod->>EvalHub: POST callback: status=COMPLETED<br/>Include evaluation results<br/>Auth: Bearer Token

    Note over Operator,OCI: Flow 2: Air-Gapped / Offline Evaluation

    Pod->>Pod: Auto-detect /test_data layout<br/>Set HF_HUB_OFFLINE=1<br/>Set TRANSFORMERS_OFFLINE=1
    Pod->>Pod: Load tokenizer from /test_data<br/>Load datasets from /test_data

    loop For each benchmark sample
        Pod->>Model: POST /v1/completions<br/>Auth: Bearer Token<br/>(no HF Hub calls)
        Model-->>Pod: Completion response
    end

    Pod->>Pod: Compute metrics locally
    Pod->>EvalHub: POST callback: status=COMPLETED
